// (:wifi, 0), and the chip has one (transport_ble_plan.md stage 12, part 6). A declaration on instance 1
// passes the language's checks and is rejected by the target's verifier, with the list of links this
// board provides. Compile-failure trial (board driver --fail-one); the golden is the ESP32-S3
// compiler's output.
carried_on lan: (:tcp) (:wifi, 1);

fn main() -> int64 {
    0
}
